      "name": "How much does a floating tree branch shelf cost at Wrydeco?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Prices range from $314.00 for compact 15\" accent branch shelves up to $7099.00 for expansive architectural branch wall bookcases. Popular 45\" square multi-tier models start at $1198.00 for self-assembly."
