      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How do floating tree branch bookshelves attach to the wall?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Floating tree shelves use heavy-duty concealed mounting brackets anchored along the central branch spine. For maximum weight support, brackets must be anchored directly into wooden wall studs."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What sizes do Wrydeco floating tree bookshelves come in?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Sizes range from compact accents (15''W x 8''H x 8''D, 24''W x 16''H x 10''D, and 30''W x 16''H x 10''D) to large multi-tier canopies (45'' x 45'' x 10''D, 50\"W x 45\"H x 8\"D, and up to 89\"W x 80\"H x 10-12\"D)."
      }
    },
