      "name": "What wood finishes are available for floating tree branch shelves?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Finishes include Dark Walnut, Warm Wood, Dark Warm Wood, Cool Dark Wood, Natural Finish, Custom, Natural, Light Oak, and Walnut. Compact models in finishes such as Dark Walnut and Warm Wood start at $314.00."
      }
    },
